{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o049b","title":"曹操败走鲁肃先还孙权举将迎礼","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o049b-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"曹操败走鲁肃先还孙权举将迎礼","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o049b-q"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-o050-judgment","label":null,"text":"鲁肃称待孙权帝业成以安车软轮征召才为显，孙权欢笑。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o050-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-su","role":"先还","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o049b-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"迎礼","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o049b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":208,"label":"赤壁前后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhouyu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhouyu-q-o009","basis":"赤壁前后"},"evidence":["zhouyu-e-o049b-q","zhouyu-q-o009","zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o049b-q","source_order":[54,235,"O049b"],"order":9650}],"persons":[{"id":"lu-su","name":"鲁肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o049b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-27591a11de61813e45a8","layer":"original","quote":"曹公破走，肃即先还。权大请诸将迎肃，肃将入<拜〖14〗，权起礼之。因谓曰：“子敬，孤持鞍下马相迎〖15〗，足以显卿未？","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":234,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o009","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。曹公得其水军船，步兵数十万。将士闻之皆恐。（惧）〔权〕延见群下〖8〗，问以计策。议者咸曰：“曹公，豺虎也！然托名汉相，挟天子以征四方，动以朝廷为辞；今日拒之，事更不顺。且将军大势：可以拒操者，长江也。今操得荆州，奄有其地〖9〗；刘表治水军，蒙冲、斗舰〖10〗，乃以千数，操悉浮以沿江；兼有步兵，水陆俱下。此为长江之险，已与我共之矣。而势力众寡，又不可论。愚谓大计不如迎之。”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o050-judgment","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c115f52770d952348cdf","layer":"original","quote":"肃趋进曰〖16〗：“未也！”众人闻之，无不愕然。就坐，徐举鞭言曰：“愿至尊威德加乎四海，总括九州〖17〗，克成帝业；更以安车软轮征肃〖18〗，始当显耳！”权抚掌欢笑。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":235,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
